  "_comment": "Search terms and feeds for the BUV daily sourcing sweep (sourcing-sweep.mjs). Add or remove terms freely. Google News queries get ' when:<days>d' appended automatically. 'news' results are kept only if the headline matches waterRegex; 'newsNames' results only if the headline contains 'must'. Headlines matching noiseRegex are always dropped. 'feeds' with filter=true keep only items matching waterRegex; filter=\"strict\" (general-interest feeds) uses strictWaterRegex, which leaves out broad terms like 'hydro' that would admit hydrogen news. 'nsfProgramRegex' picks which NSF award programs are listed (I-Corps teams are pre-company university spinouts); an I-Corps award is listed only if its title matches 'iCorpsTitleRegex', because I-Corps spans every field of science. 'priorityThemes' only TAGS candidate lines [FIT: …] — themes Alex has moved to Exploring/Diligence above his base rate (measured from his Deal Pipeline decisions); tagging never filters anything out; a theme with alsoWater=true is tagged only when the same text also matches waterRegex.",
